{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:cf34ede2a0ef324b","name":"Flame Cannon","source":{"id":"source:reference-cf34ede2a0ef324b","title":"Flame Cannon","revision":20869,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:40:56Z","sha256":"4c3cc417be6879077051d1f4c636c904d2fa87bea898f62b69fc62ee9521cc0e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20869","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Flame%20Cannon&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-cf34ede2a0ef324b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Flame Cannon is a larger version of the regular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flamethrower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flamethrower","referenceId":"reference:3c07f870ddf7e92b"},", with a considerably longer range, hotter temperature, and greater fuel capacity. Examples include the Merr-Sonn Model CR-28 and the Czerka CZ-28 Flamestrike. Mounted on ground ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," or tripods, the Flame Cannon is ideal for clearing out bunkers or as a weapon of shock and terror. When mounted on a tripod, the Flame Cannon is treated as one size smaller for purposes of being wielded, allowing a Medium character to operate it with two hands. The Flame Cannon shoot a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cone"}," of burning chemicals 12 squares long and 8 squares wide at the terminus.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Make a single attack roll and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of every target within this area. A successful attack deals 5d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"}," damage to the target. If the attack misses, the target instead takes half damage. A target with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent takes half damage from a successful attack and no damage if the attack misses. The normal rules for taking ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"}," damage apply.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Reloading a Flame Cannon is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". The weapon can be used 20 times before its chemical supply is depleted. Replacement tanks for the Flame Cannon cost 600 credits and weigh 20 kg each.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Huge\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 3,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 5d6 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 15 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," This is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," weapon.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," A Flame Cannon mounted on a tripod is treated as a Large weapon, rather than Huge.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
